0..47 Comment "//! This source shows pattern holes in matches."
48..51 Comment "//!"
52..122 Comment "//! A pattern hole stands for an unwritten arm or payload. The checker"
123..150 Comment "//! cannot decide coverage."
151..154 Comment "//!"
155..231 Comment "//! The checker refuses the match by name with `UndecidedCoverage`. Coverage"
232..261 Comment "//! does not read a hole yet."
262..265 Comment "//!"
266..353 Comment "//! - see: `corpus/pathological/holes/` — each source refuses one pattern-hole shape."
